</span></div></nav></section><div style="height:0px;display:none"></div><main id="main" class="WebPage_webPage__cafAL"><div class="-visually-hidden"><section class="HeroImage13_hero__Y4K0A -bg-plum-900 HeroImage13_-padding-lg__vABDp HeroImage13_-min-height-size-default__9rUfW" data-track-mbox="cm_bank_OSA_Hero"><div class="HeroImage13_heroGridWrapper__95Hej grid-col-2 HeroImage13_-gutter-lg__5ZAsm HeroImage13_-align-bottom__93v3W"><div class="Card_card__KHG0_ -bg-plum-900 Card_-radius-leaf__sukm7 Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 HeroImage13_heroCard__ddYJ9"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-darkMode___xRbY"><h1 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h1" class="Text_heading-slg__CqFpo -mt-xxs -mb-0 -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC RichText_-font-weight-400__9ML_a RichText_-eyebrow__zWcgK" tabindex="-1">Ally Bank Savings Account</h1><h2 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h2" class="Text_heading-xlr__zG8eW -mt-xxs -mb-xs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Save smarter for what matters most.</h2><span class="-visually-hidden">3.1% correct as of 10/08/26</span></div><a class="Link_ctaPrimary__H4y9b Link_-dark__6RmSy Link_-align-center__E5gfL" data-allytmln="defaultbanner-openNewAccount" href="" target="_self" aria-label="Open Online Savings Account">Open New Account</a></div><div class=" ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-1 ExperienceContent_-align-center__Atnpk ExperienceContent_-align-bottom__HWf5X"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-bottom__yTtvL RichText_-darkMode___xRbY"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC"> </p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="StickyNav_scrollWatcher__Bw0TE"></div><section class="Section_section__CRZ0c " id="Tools"><div class="Section_sectionContainer__DiKn9"><div class="Section_sectionContent__bg_Qs grid-col-1-flex Section_-align-center__4Bqiw Section_-align-top__26xRM"><div class="Content80_experienceContent__o3faX Content80_-content-80__NOf5T Content80_experienceContent__o3faX"><div class="Content80_contentWrapper__SbpKh grid-col-1 Content80_-align-center__huGfT"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z"><h2 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h2" class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL -mt-xxs -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Finally a savings account that lets your money work smarter.</strong></h2><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC">Along with a competitive, variable rate and no monthly maintenance fees, the Ally Bank Savings Account comes with tools to help grow your money faster. We found people have saved, on average, <a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" aria-label="See how people save, on average, 2x more with our smart savings tools" role="button" href="##">2x more</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div>Save 2x more with smart savings tools</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">People who actively use our smart savings tools grow their total savings balance 2x more, on average, during their first 12 months than those who don&#x27;t. This is based on the average balance growth of accounts opened since we launched our smart savings tools.</p></div></div></div> when they’ve used our smart savings tools.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="-visually-hidden"><section class="Section25_section__c9TQT " id="section-6a2XvxjyjhOrpvQV73T9fK" data-track-mbox="onlineSavingsAccountToolsSectionBulletsCopyTest"><div class="Section25_sectionContainer__wE58Y"><div class="Section25_sectionContent__0Cyxr grid-col-2"><img alt="Track your progress and see the impact boosters can make in a crisp, clear chart." class="styles_Image__YRv0H styles_-align-left__Mi5oa styles_-align-middle__9MIVr " src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/62YilPGxBUCgwEv4vDRK2q/0144b76f1e6f71dbebf470725bafc18d/62567-tablet-mobile-bank-app-v1.avif?w=459&amp;h=305&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp" srcSet="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/62YilPGxBUCgwEv4vDRK2q/0144b76f1e6f71dbebf470725bafc18d/62567-tablet-mobile-bank-app-v1.avif?w=459&amp;h=305&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp 1x" loading="lazy"/><div class=" ExperienceContentIcon_experienceContent__WK1ov grid-col-1 ExperienceContentIcon_-align-left__fagKy ExperienceContentIcon_-align-top__HekDg"><div class="ExperienceContentIcon_itemWrapper__pZLQL"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ExperienceContentIcon_svgIcon__lRV8v" width="64" height="64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/1P64JBm7fGElQiJFTPFt8u/480a7dd74d3931b22825109c59c88b1f/3ci_money_nobg.svg" width="64" height="64"></image></svg><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-slg__CqFpo -mt-sm -mb-xxs" tabindex="-1">Analyze where you&#x27;ve been.</h3><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Get a clear picture of what&#x27;s moving the needle for your savings balance.</p></div></div><div class="ExperienceContentIcon_itemWrapper__pZLQL"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ExperienceContentIcon_svgIcon__lRV8v" width="64" height="64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/EvrnPtL3v0L2LEGkioii4/6964faeae7b56ce452442e763b97fc9f/3ci_forecast_nobg.svg" width="64" height="64"></image></svg><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-slg__CqFpo -mt-sm -mb-xxs" tabindex="-1">Visualize where you could go.</h3><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Crunch the numbers to find out how using our tools, even for small changes, could help you reach your goals.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><section class="Section35_section__uY1E3 " id="section-4jdlh2aVIjKpnSyIqW66aC"><div class="Section35_sectionContainer__JHiKh"><h2 class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section35_sectionHeading__jnKdj -mb-xs" tabindex="-1">Organize using buckets.</h2><p class="Text_body-md__aYHxV Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section35_sectionHeading__jnKdj -mb-lg">Set money aside for what matters to you. All in one place.</p><div class="Section35_sectionContent__4jdtx grid-col-2-flex Section35_-grid-template__lQ4wx"><div class="Video_video__Hc6aE"><div><div class="Video_brightcove__HEKlK"></div></div></div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm RichText_-align-middle__ohKAQ"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-md__A6fRB -mt-sm -mb-xxs" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Divvy up your savings without multiple bank accounts or hard math.</strong></h3><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Like digital envelopes, savings buckets stash your cash for whatever you want (or want to do). Use them to track your progress, all while earning interest on your total balance. Then, carry that organizational savvy into your spending using our <a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" href="https://www.ally.com/bank/interest-checking-account/#tools" target="_self">spending buckets</a>.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="Section_section__CRZ0c " id="section-3Rdf2aPofoG4ZfqRhulU58"><div class="Section_sectionContainer__DiKn9"><h2 class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section_sectionHeading__tK95j -mb-xs" tabindex="-1">Optimize with boosters.</h2><p class="Text_body-md__aYHxV Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section_sectionSubheading__19uqi -mb-lg">Accelerate your savings and put part of your strategy on autopilot.</p><div class="Section_sectionContent__bg_Qs grid-col-1 Section_-align-center__4Bqiw Section_-align-top__26xRM"><div class=" ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-3 ExperienceContent_-align-center__Atnpk ExperienceContent_-align-top__k5GPm"><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-default__uD2Gt Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ"><svg aria-hidden="false" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M" width="64" height="64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Cycle with Background</title><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/5iwoIiE5fcHOWQaO03s2jz/7d0969b64493c9b7d37cf028b314b20d/3ci_cycle.svg" width="64" height="64"></image></svg><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Recurring Transfers</strong></h3><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC">Set it and forget it. Move money into your savings on a schedule that makes sense for you.</p></div></div><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-default__uD2Gt Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M" width="64" height="64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/f5q8u7dw9jDp0fIXXFWOX/1c961fda0b613fff71459579e25b78f8/3ci_payment.svg" width="64" height="64"></image></svg><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Round Ups</strong></h3><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC">We track your spending accounts with us for transactions we can round up to the nearest dollar. When you accrue at least $5 in round ups, we transfer it to your savings.</p></div><a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-no-inline__7AGiC Link_-align-center__E5gfL Link_-align-top__5jINq Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" role="button" href="##">More about how it works</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div>More about how round ups work</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Each transfer will be between $5 - $20, and we’ll do our best to make sure your round up transfers won’t get you close to a $0 balance.</p><ul class="RichText_richText-list-unordered__sXpVj"><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We round up transactions like debit card purchases, electronic payments, and checks written from your Ally Bank Spending Account</p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Track more than one account for round ups</p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Make changes or stop round ups whenever you want</p></li></ul><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-xs -mb-xs" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Keep in mind</strong></h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">You can’t cancel this type of transfer once it starts, but you can instantly move money back to your checking account whenever you want.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-default__uD2Gt Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M" width="64" height="64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/zvJR8oho0D3CLZRR3Of4g/018a0243fd3edf5bcd035391cc60baaa/3ci_surprise.svg" width="64" height="64"></image></svg><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Surprise Savings</strong></h3><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC">We analyze your linked checking accounts for safe-to-save money, then transfer it to your savings so you don’t have to. </p></div></div></div><div class="-keep-desktop-columns ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-2-flex ExperienceContent_-align-center__Atnpk ExperienceContent_-align-middle__ZrERv"><img alt="" class="styles_Image__YRv0H styles_-align-center__7hn_U styles_-align-middle__9MIVr " src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/2uNuZGRFbtrriWo1ryJnxP/d1114060bff48561c74b409cae8a9274/play-button-plum-800-32.svg?h=32&amp;w=32&amp;q=90" srcSet="" loading="lazy"/><a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-no-inline__7AGiC Link_-align-center__E5gfL Link_-align-middle__CA3_G Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" role="button" href="##">See how boosters work</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div> See how boosters work</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><div class="Video_video__Hc6aE"><div><div class="Video_brightcove__HEKlK"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="SectionXXL_section___e2vD " id="section-1WLjAGcLpSWrmhvabZk6cN"><div class="SectionXXL_sectionContainer__0qh4q"><div class="SectionXXL_sectionContent__wshFC grid-col-2-flex"><img alt="A phone screen showing savings buckets and boosters with the text &quot;You&#x27;ve saved $56.63 with Round Ups this year&quot;" class="styles_Image__YRv0H styles_-align-left__Mi5oa styles_-align-top__hpVXX " src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/PucxP5hERVmBC86c8IgvW/01ea706dbd3c20ec32d74f1c2a75b48e/bucket-and-boosters-phone-ui.avif?w=447&amp;h=368&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp" srcSet="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/PucxP5hERVmBC86c8IgvW/01ea706dbd3c20ec32d74f1c2a75b48e/bucket-and-boosters-phone-ui.avif?w=447&amp;h=368&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp 1x" loading="lazy"/><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h2 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h2" class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL -mt-xxs -mb-xs" tabindex="-1">Meet our dynamic duo.</h2><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Our Savings and <a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="spendingAccountBoostersSection" href="/bank/interest-checking-account" target="_self">Spending Accounts</a> work better together. With features like round ups and buckets, you can grow your savings while staying on top of everyday spending.</p><a class="Link_ctaOutline__Q8prV" data-allytmln="openBothAccounts" href="https://secure.ally.com/open-account?&amp;OAP=OSAV" target="_self">Open Both Accounts</a></div></div></div></section><section class="Section_section__CRZ0c -bg-plum-900 Section_-has-bg__9_IGk" id="features"><div class="Section_sectionContainer__DiKn9"><div class="Section_sectionContent__bg_Qs grid-col-1 Section_-align-center__4Bqiw Section_-align-top__26xRM"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu RichText_-darkMode___xRbY"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-md__A6fRB -mt-sm -mb-xxs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Come for the helpful tools. Stay for everything else. </h3></div><div class="SectionBankFeatures_featuresExperienceContent__rvZBt ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-4 ExperienceContent_-align-center__Atnpk ExperienceContent_-align-top__k5GPm"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu RichText_-darkMode___xRbY"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M RichText_richText-svg___ZLow" width="80" height="80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/1CDfHsCHOITF5OlHfL97CO/a81cbdbd199d52038fcc0bcaf270aaf5/3ci_payment_no_bg.svg" width="80" height="80"></image></svg><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-0 -mb-xs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">No monthly maintenance fees or minimum balance requirements.</strong></h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC">Keep in mind, with this type of account there’s a limit of 10 withdrawals per statement cycle.
</p><a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-dark__6RmSy Link_-no-inline__7AGiC Link_-embedded-block___x1B8 Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" role="button" href="##">About the transaction limit</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div>About the Transaction Limit</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We limit certain types of withdrawals and transfers from Savings and Money Market Accounts to a combined total of 10 per statement cycle. Depending on your account type, these limited transactions include things like Online and Mobile Banking transfers (between Ally Bank accounts or to a third party), Overdraft Transfer Service, checks, and point-of-sale transactions (such as debit card purchases).</p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We don’t charge a fee for going over the limit. However, we’ll close your account if you exceed it on more than an occasional basis.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu RichText_-darkMode___xRbY"><img alt="" class="styles_Image__YRv0H RichText_image__35cB_" src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/6orM8WaP12uLsfv7Oloyab/02c0a269b014b88bb6506192379579e9/member-fdic.svg?h=37&amp;w=61&amp;q=90" srcSet="" loading="lazy"/><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-0 -mb-xs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Your money earns money with </strong><a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda Tooltip_-dark__PWIKb" data-allytmln="dejarg-interestCompoundedDaily" href="##" data-state="closed">interest compounded daily</a>.</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC">Rate is variable and may change after the account is opened. Deposits are insured by the <a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda Tooltip_-dark__PWIKb" href="##" data-state="closed">FDIC</a> up to the maximum allowed by law.</p><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-dark__6RmSy Link_-no-inline__7AGiC Link_-embedded-block___x1B8" href="/bank/fdic" target="_self">More about FDIC coverage</a></div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu RichText_-darkMode___xRbY"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M RichText_richText-svg___ZLow" width="80" height="80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/5PVc4YB44W6WmpJUwkkJtB/9e7d678b97694021734ec4025b85f034/3ci_rate_no_bg.svg" width="80" height="80"></image></svg><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-0 -mb-xs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Earn more than 5x the national average.</strong></h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC">The national average for this type of account is 0.37% APY, based on rates published in the FDIC Monthly National Rates and Rate Caps accurate as of 9/21/2026.</p></div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu RichText_-darkMode___xRbY"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M RichText_richText-svg___ZLow" width="80" height="80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/1lnDLKtWfrziiXRRsZc1mp/57f04361701fb4768c761a62cc0fadc2/3ci_chat_nobg.svg" width="80" height="80"></image></svg><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-0 -mb-xs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">24/7 support.</strong></h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white Text_-align-center__DZFHC">Call, chat or email us any time. A real person is always available to help, day or night. </p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="SectionCard80_section__Qa8_A  -column-1" id="section-6kWS1LLDzIEEGPQpl5NGO2"><div class="SectionCard80_sectionContainer__rG9PO"><div class="SectionCard80_sectionContent__w6Cby grid-col-1"><div class="Card_card__KHG0_ -bg-plum-100 Card_-radius-large__6RJe6 Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-middle__LkK72 SectionCard80_sectionCard__8cSs1 SectionCard80_-align-center__39nqD SectionCard80_-align-middle__Ek8V8"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-middle__ohKAQ"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Direct deposit is a breeze.</strong></h3><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC">Let us prefill your form so you can focus on growing your savings.</p><a class="Link_ctaPrimary__H4y9b" href="/bank/direct-deposit" target="_self">Explore Direct Deposit</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="Section_section__CRZ0c " id="rates"><div class="Section_sectionContainer__DiKn9"><h2 class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section_sectionHeading__tK95j -mb-xs" tabindex="-1">See how we compare.</h2><p class="Text_body-md__aYHxV Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section_sectionSubheading__19uqi -mb-lg">Our features maximize the way you save. Take a look for yourself.</p><div class="Section_sectionContent__bg_Qs grid-col-4 Section_-align-center__4Bqiw Section_-align-top__26xRM"><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-none__ghSCk Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW sectionOsaCompareCards_compareCardsRichText__itlfR RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><img alt="Ally Bank" class="styles_Image__YRv0H RichText_image__35cB_" src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/5sXN86UltmWFcqa4216deU/9011c9f970f2f4d17bddb57a798fe99b/22682_Logo_Ally_v2.avif?w=83&amp;h=50&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp" srcSet="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/5sXN86UltmWFcqa4216deU/9011c9f970f2f4d17bddb57a798fe99b/22682_Logo_Ally_v2.avif?w=83&amp;h=50&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp 1x" loading="lazy"/><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_subtitle-lg__nmd_j -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Savings Account</h3><hr class="RichText_richText-hr__UI5oC"/><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">monthly maintenance fees</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">minimum opening deposit</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Tool to organize your savings—no additional account required:</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Yes -</strong> <a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" role="button" href="##">Buckets</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div>Buckets, explained</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><img alt="" class="styles_Image__YRv0H RichText_image__35cB_" src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3spHgGw2Uasv49Ly5Z50tj/05e96ec33703add7ff54245e885b9983/62567-STK-buckets.avif?w=464&amp;h=178&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp" srcSet="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3spHgGw2Uasv49Ly5Z50tj/05e96ec33703add7ff54245e885b9983/62567-STK-buckets.avif?w=464&amp;h=178&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp 1x" loading="lazy"/><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Buckets allow you to dedicate parts of your savings to whatever you want. Think of them as digital envelopes. You can create up to 30 savings buckets, plus you’ll still earn interest on the total balance of your account.</p></div></div></div></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Tool to analyze any linked checking account for safe-to-save money:</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Yes -</strong> <a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" role="button" href="##">Surprise Savings</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div>Surprise Savings, explained.</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><div class=" ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-2-flex ExperienceContent_-align-left__F5Tq0"><img alt="" class="styles_Image__YRv0H " src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/dMKuqKG2x1DNF0sU3xGRV/7913fda65e553a776483618eee42c638/savings-icon-surprise-savings.svg?h=40&amp;w=52&amp;q=90" srcSet="" loading="lazy"/><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Link any checking account you want us to analyze – even checking accounts you have somewhere else. Once you turn on this booster, our advanced analytics compares what you normally spend in your linked checking accounts and identifies any safe-to-save money, then transfers it to your Savings Account.</p></div></div></div></div></div></p><span class="-visually-hidden">3.1% correct as of 10/08/26</span></div></div><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-none__ghSCk Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW sectionOsaCompareCards_compareCardsRichText__itlfR RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><img alt="Bank of America" class="styles_Image__YRv0H RichText_image__35cB_" src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/7nbYH3iXsxS1WIYlc1NTxQ/ed76a1a2aa8a480ee19c4bc01989b771/22682_Logo_bofa.avif?w=160&amp;h=50&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp" srcSet="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/7nbYH3iXsxS1WIYlc1NTxQ/ed76a1a2aa8a480ee19c4bc01989b771/22682_Logo_bofa.avif?w=160&amp;h=50&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp 1x" loading="lazy"/><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_subtitle-lg__nmd_j -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Advantage Savings</h3><hr class="RichText_richText-hr__UI5oC"/><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">monthly maintenance fees</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$8</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">minimum opening deposit</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$100</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Tool to organize your savings—no additional account required:</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Yes</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Tool to analyze any linked checking account for safe-to-save money:</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">No</strong></p><span class="-visually-hidden">0.04% correct as of 10/08/26</span></div></div><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-none__ghSCk Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW sectionOsaCompareCards_compareCardsRichText__itlfR RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><img alt="Chase Bank" class="styles_Image__YRv0H RichText_image__35cB_" src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/06vyMgiTx1AYgEzGSDsHh/36227c95c8d1e70d920269e6dbbe33bb/22682_Logo_Chase.webp?w=160&amp;h=50&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp" srcSet="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/06vyMgiTx1AYgEzGSDsHh/36227c95c8d1e70d920269e6dbbe33bb/22682_Logo_Chase.webp?w=160&amp;h=50&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp 1x" loading="lazy"/><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_subtitle-lg__nmd_j -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Chase Savings<sup class="RichText_richText-sup__jLmP4" data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_superscript">SM</sup></h3><hr class="RichText_richText-hr__UI5oC"/><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">monthly maintenance fees</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$5</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">minimum opening deposit</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Tool to organize your savings—no additional account required:</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">No</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Tool to analyze any linked checking account for safe-to-save money:</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">No</strong></p><span class="-visually-hidden">0.01% correct as of 10/08/26</span></div></div><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-none__ghSCk Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW sectionOsaCompareCards_compareCardsRichText__itlfR RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><img alt="Wells Fargo" class="styles_Image__YRv0H RichText_image__35cB_" src="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/44PfYxZ6Gr6ZCKMzuQwnlo/2dad63e8e3f28952f84acdc4f43ce6c0/22682_Logo_WF.webp?w=160&amp;h=50&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp" srcSet="https://secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/44PfYxZ6Gr6ZCKMzuQwnlo/2dad63e8e3f28952f84acdc4f43ce6c0/22682_Logo_WF.webp?w=160&amp;h=50&amp;q=90&amp;fm=webp 1x" loading="lazy"/><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_subtitle-lg__nmd_j -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Way2Save® Savings</h3><hr class="RichText_richText-hr__UI5oC"/><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">monthly maintenance fees</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$5</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">minimum opening deposit</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$25</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Tool to organize your savings—no additional account required:</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">No</strong></p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Tool to analyze any linked checking account for safe-to-save money:</h4><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-sm Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">No</strong></p><span class="-visually-hidden">0.01% correct as of 10/08/26</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="Section45_section__0uG_T " id="section-P9KC8OSLM2rJbAZitwPDK"><div class="Section45_sectionContainer__kfjed"><div class="Section45_sectionContent__RKF_S grid-col-2-flex Section45_-grid-template__i5Fbs"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-md__A6fRB -mt-sm -mb-xxs" tabindex="-1">What you should know.</h3><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Our features information is accurate as of 9/21/2026.</p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">
Banks with maintenance fees often offer more than one condition, one of which you may be able to satisfy, to waive the fee or fees.</p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Our Annual Percentage Yields (APYs) are accurate as of <time class="EffectiveDate_effectiveDate__M3Me5">10/08/2026</time>. Keep in mind, these rates are variable and may change after the account is open. Fees may reduce earnings. The APYs for other banks are provided by mybanktracker.com and are accurate as of <time class="EffectiveDate_effectiveDate__M3Me5">10/06/2026</time>. The APYs in this table are for the state of California and based on a minimum daily balance of $5,000.</p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Ally Bank Savings Accounts have a range of account balances called balance tiers. We’re required to tell you the APY we pay is based on the tier in which your end-of-day balance falls. The APY may remain the same for all balance tiers or change based on your account’s daily balance.</p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">That being said, we’ve simply made the current APY available across all our balance tiers.</p><h4 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h4" class="Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-xs -mb-xs" tabindex="-1">Ally Bank Savings Account balance tiers:</h4><ul class="RichText_richText-list-unordered__sXpVj"><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Less than $5,000</p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Between $5,000 and $24,999.99</p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">$25,000 or more</p></li></ul><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">The APY we pay is based on the tier in which your end-of-day balance falls. APYs are variable and subject to change.</p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">The APY of our Savings Account is more than 5x the national average of 0.37% APY, based on the national average of savings accounts rates published in the FDIC Monthly National Rates and Rate Caps accurate as of 9/21/2026.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="Section_section__CRZ0c SectionBankFees_sectionBankFees__08axB " id="fees"><div class="Section_sectionContainer__DiKn9"><h2 class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section_sectionHeading__tK95j -mb-xs" tabindex="-1">Fees, a short story.</h2><p class="Text_body-md__aYHxV Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section_sectionSubheading__19uqi -mb-lg">You shouldn&#x27;t be nickel and dimed for using your own money.</p><div class="Section_sectionContent__bg_Qs grid-col-2 Section_-align-left__Kq0_9 Section_-align-top__26xRM"><div class="SectionBankFees_sectionBankFees__08axB ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-1 ExperienceContent_-align-left__F5Tq0 ExperienceContent_-align-top__k5GPm"><div class="SectionBankFees_sectionBankFees__08axB RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-md__A6fRB -mt-0 -mb-xxs" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">There&#x27;s a lot we don&#x27;t charge for</strong></h3></div><div class="Table_richText__zh2FK Table_-center__J__ly SectionBankFees_sectionBankFees__08axB"><table tabindex="-1" class="Table_table__pUF7n Table_richText__zh2FK Table_-justify__l1oVr Table_-center__J__ly"><thead class="Table_header__J9z9P"><tr><th id="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_header-cell__LwlF2 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h Table_-visually-hidden__Yj31t">RichText-Table-header-1</th><th id="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_header-cell__LwlF2 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h Table_-visually-hidden__Yj31t">RichText-Table-header-2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="Table_row__rm7aq"><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Monthly maintenance fees</p></div></td><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-2"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p></div></td></tr><tr class="Table_row__rm7aq"><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda" href="##" data-state="closed">Overdraft item</a> fees</p></div></td><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-2"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p></div></td></tr><tr class="Table_row__rm7aq"><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda" href="##" data-state="closed">Standard</a> or <a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda" href="##" data-state="closed">expedited</a> ACH transfers</p></div></td><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-2"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p></div></td></tr><tr class="Table_row__rm7aq"><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Incoming wires (domestic and international)</p></div></td><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-2"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p></div></td></tr><tr class="Table_row__rm7aq"><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda" href="##" data-state="closed">Official/cashier&#x27;s checks</a></p></div></td><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-2"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p></div></td></tr><tr class="Table_row__rm7aq"><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" role="button" href="##">Excessive transactions</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div>About the Transaction Limit</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We limit certain types of withdrawals and transfers from Savings and Money Market Accounts to a combined total of 10 per statement cycle. Depending on your account type, these limited transactions include things like Online and Mobile Banking transfers (between Ally Bank accounts or to a third party), Overdraft Transfer Service, checks, and point-of-sale transactions (such as debit card purchases).</p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We don’t charge a fee for going over the limit. However, we’ll close your account if you exceed it on more than an occasional basis.</p></div></div></div> fee</p></div></td><td headers="_R_57maqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-2"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$0</strong></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="SectionBankFees_sectionBankFees__08axB ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-1 ExperienceContent_-align-left__F5Tq0 ExperienceContent_-align-top__k5GPm"><div class="SectionBankFees_sectionBankFees__08axB RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h3 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h3" class="Text_heading-md__A6fRB -mt-0 -mb-xxs" tabindex="-1"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">...and we won&#x27;t hide the fees we do have.</strong></h3></div><div class="Table_richText__zh2FK Table_-center__J__ly SectionBankFees_sectionBankFees__08axB"><table tabindex="-1" class="Table_table__pUF7n Table_richText__zh2FK Table_-justify__l1oVr Table_-center__J__ly"><thead class="Table_header__J9z9P"><tr><th id="_R_5bmaqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_header-cell__LwlF2 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h Table_-visually-hidden__Yj31t">RichText-Table-header-1</th><th id="_R_5bmaqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_header-cell__LwlF2 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h Table_-visually-hidden__Yj31t">RichText-Table-header-2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="Table_row__rm7aq"><td headers="_R_5bmaqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Expedited delivery</p></div></td><td headers="_R_5bmaqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-2"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$15</strong></p></div></td></tr><tr class="Table_row__rm7aq"><td headers="_R_5bmaqnpfiupfdb_-col-0" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Outgoing <a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda" href="##" data-state="closed">domestic</a> wires</p></div></td><td headers="_R_5bmaqnpfiupfdb_-col-1" class="Table_cell__2QTk8 Table_-bg-transparent__e8z_h" data-header="RichText-Table-header-2"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">$20</strong></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></section><section class="SectionCard100_section__kP3O9 " id="getting-started"><div class="SectionCard100_sectionContainer___5TK6"><div class="SectionCard100_sectionContent__fQcCk grid-col-1"><div class="Card_card__KHG0_ -bg-gradient-p900-p500 grid-col-2 Card_-radius-large__6RJe6 Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-left__eCMNt Card_-align-top__7lQIZ SectionCard100_sectionCard__SMql6 SectionCard100_-card-100-step__uVIOC SectionCard100_-align-left__Hj9lY SectionCard100_-align-top__hKSI_"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW SectionCard100_cardRichText__h91iK RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm RichText_-align-top__chODu RichText_-darkMode___xRbY"><h2 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h2" class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL -mt-0 -mb-xs -color-white" tabindex="-1">Better banking, starting now.</h2><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white">Get your account up and running in minutes.</p></div><div class="ListStep_container___R5wR"><ol class="ListStep_list__5oRr_ ListStep_list-stepper__d84SB ListStep_-white__KCjzA ListStep_-dark-mode__qXR9v"><li class="ListStep_list-item__z2Fii"><div class="ListStep_list-item-container__6GC2_"><span class="ListStep_list-item-number__1IcPr"></span><span class="ListStep_list-item-dots__l3tJQ"></span></div><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Tell us about yourself.</strong>
We&#x27;ll need some personal info, like your address and Social Security number.</p></div></li><li class="ListStep_list-item__z2Fii"><div class="ListStep_list-item-container__6GC2_"><span class="ListStep_list-item-number__1IcPr"></span><span class="ListStep_list-item-dots__l3tJQ"></span></div><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Add money to your account.</strong>
The faster you fund, the sooner you&#x27;ll earn interest.</p></div></li><li class="ListStep_list-item__z2Fii"><div class="ListStep_list-item-container__6GC2_"><span class="ListStep_list-item-number__1IcPr"></span><span class="ListStep_list-item-dots__l3tJQ"></span></div><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Enjoy all the perks.</strong>
