.885-1.002-3.078-6.256A1.142 1.142 0 0038 .5zm26 0c-.458 0-.853.27-1.035.66l-3.078 6.256-6.885 1.002a1.148 1.148 0 00-.639 1.975l4.98 4.869-1.175 6.875a1.145 1.145 0 001.674 1.22L64 20.111l6.158 3.246c.376.209.852.194 1.223-.076.37-.27.533-.721.451-1.144l-1.176-6.875 4.98-4.87a1.148 1.148 0 00-.638-1.974l-6.885-1.002-3.078-6.256A1.142 1.142 0 0064 .5zm26 0c-.458 0-.853.27-1.035.66l-3.078 6.256-6.885 1.002a1.148 1.148 0 00-.639 1.975l4.98 4.869-1.175 6.875a1.145 1.145 0 001.674 1.22L90 20.111l6.158 3.246c.376.209.852.194 1.223-.076.37-.27.533-.721.451-1.144l-1.176-6.875 4.98-4.87a1.148 1.148 0 00-.638-1.974l-6.885-1.002-3.078-6.256A1.142 1.142 0 0090 .5zm26 0c-.458 0-.853.27-1.035.66l-3.078 6.256-6.885 1.002a1.148 1.148 0 00-.639 1.975l4.98 4.869-1.175 6.875a1.145 1.145 0 001.674 1.22L116 20.111l6.158 3.246c.376.209.852.194 1.223-.076.37-.27.533-.721.451-1.144l-1.176-6.875 4.98-4.87a1.148 1.148 0 00-.638-1.974l-6.885-1.002-3.078-6.256A1.142 1.142 0 00116 .5z"></path></svg></svg></div><p class="Text_subtitle-lg__nmd_j -mb-xs">Account Features</p><p class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mb-xs">I love the Bucket feature that Ally provides because it allows me to set savings goals for every kind of goal I have. The ability to transfer funds from one bucket to another is seemless. 

My only con to the savings bucket is that when a goal is created for a certain amount and is...</p><p class="Text_body-md__aYHxV">- LivingLife2theFullest on 9/27/2026</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="SectionFAQ_section__cdJWv " id="faqs"><div class="SectionFAQ_sectionContainer__Zp66O"><h2 class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL SectionFAQ_sectionHeading__b_Eym -mb-xxs" tabindex="-1">FAQs</h2><p class="Text_subtitle-md__KAvok -mt-0 -mb-sm SectionFAQ_sectionSubHeading__Z8b8w -mb-xxs">We have answers.</p><div class="SectionFAQ_sectionContent__a7atb grid-col-1"><div class="Accordion_accordionRoot___IS8j" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="Accordion_accordionItem__M4BZW"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_nnqqnpfiupfdb_" class="Accordion_accordionHeader__CXvux Accordion_accordionTrigger__aXh6r" aria-label="How do I add money to my account?" data-radix-collection-item=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M Accordion_accordionTriggerIcon__egW7x" name="Chevron: Right" data-testid="Chevron: Right" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin"><path fill-rule="nonzero" d="M16 12a.959.959 0 0 1-.08.393c-.053.12-.137.235-.252.346l-5.094 4.995A.876.876 0 0 1 9.93 18a.905.905 0 0 1-.468-.123.946.946 0 0 1-.336-.333.926.926 0 0 1 .166-1.142L13.808 12 9.292 7.598A.926.926 0 0 1 9 6.926a.88.88 0 0 1 .126-.463.974.974 0 0 1 .336-.336A.887.887 0 0 1 9.93 6c.252 0 .467.089.644.266l5.094 4.995c.11.11.193.226.246.346.053.12.082.25.086.393Z"></path></svg>How do I add money to my account?</button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_4nnqqnpfiupfdb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_nnqqnpfiupfdb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="Accordion_accordionContent___gX9O" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4" tabindex="-1"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">There are several ways to add money to your account: </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">1. Online transfers:</strong> You can transfer money from another Ally account or an account you have at another institution, right from our app. Select<strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold"> Menu </strong>and then <strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Linked Accounts </strong>to link your accounts at other banks. </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">2. Ally eCheck Deposit℠:</strong> You can deposit a check in our app with your phone’s camera. Make sure each check is properly endorsed with signatures of all payees. Also write <strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">For Mobile Deposit Only </strong>on the back. </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">3. Wire transfer:</strong> If you want to wire money from an account you have at another institution, select <strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Menu </strong>and then choose<strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold"> Wire Money.</strong> Then select <strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Receive a wire</strong> for more info on how you can wire from another financial institution into your Ally Bank account. </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">4. Mail your check:</strong> Make sure each check is properly endorsed with signatures of all payees and include a deposit slip if you have one. Also write your account number and <strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">For Deposit Only </strong>on the back. Be sure to seal the envelope properly and mail it to us at: </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">     Ally Bank 
     P.O. Box 13625 
     Philadelphia, PA 
     19101-3625 </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">5. Direct deposit:</strong> Head over to our <strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">direct deposit setup page</strong> and set it up with your payment provider to automatically add money to your account every time you get paid. </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">6. Add cash to a Spending Account: </strong>Visit a Walmart Money Center or customer service desk and show the associate your unique barcode to add cash. To get your barcode, log in to our app, go to<strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold"> Menu </strong>and select<strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold"> Add Cash</strong>.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="Accordion_accordionItem__M4BZW"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_17nqqnpfiupfdb_" class="Accordion_accordionHeader__CXvux Accordion_accordionTrigger__aXh6r" aria-label="How many withdrawals can I make from my Savings Account each month?" data-radix-collection-item=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M Accordion_accordionTriggerIcon__egW7x" name="Chevron: Right" data-testid="Chevron: Right" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin"><path fill-rule="nonzero" d="M16 12a.959.959 0 0 1-.08.393c-.053.12-.137.235-.252.346l-5.094 4.995A.876.876 0 0 1 9.93 18a.905.905 0 0 1-.468-.123.946.946 0 0 1-.336-.333.926.926 0 0 1 .166-1.142L13.808 12 9.292 7.598A.926.926 0 0 1 9 6.926a.88.88 0 0 1 .126-.463.974.974 0 0 1 .336-.336A.887.887 0 0 1 9.93 6c.252 0 .467.089.644.266l5.094 4.995c.11.11.193.226.246.346.053.12.082.25.086.393Z"></path></svg>How many withdrawals can I make from my Savings Account each month?</button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_57nqqnpfiupfdb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_17nqqnpfiupfdb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="Accordion_accordionContent___gX9O" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4" tabindex="-1"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">You can make 10 limited withdrawals and transfers per statement cycle from your Savings Account. There’s no fee for going over the limit, but we’ll close your account if you exceed it on more than an occasional basis.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="Accordion_accordionItem__M4BZW"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_1nnqqnpfiupfdb_" class="Accordion_accordionHeader__CXvux Accordion_accordionTrigger__aXh6r" aria-label="What&#x27;s the difference between a savings account and money market account?" data-radix-collection-item=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M Accordion_accordionTriggerIcon__egW7x" name="Chevron: Right" data-testid="Chevron: Right" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin"><path fill-rule="nonzero" d="M16 12a.959.959 0 0 1-.08.393c-.053.12-.137.235-.252.346l-5.094 4.995A.876.876 0 0 1 9.93 18a.905.905 0 0 1-.468-.123.946.946 0 0 1-.336-.333.926.926 0 0 1 .166-1.142L13.808 12 9.292 7.598A.926.926 0 0 1 9 6.926a.88.88 0 0 1 .126-.463.974.974 0 0 1 .336-.336A.887.887 0 0 1 9.93 6c.252 0 .467.089.644.266l5.094 4.995c.11.11.193.226.246.346.053.12.082.25.086.393Z"></path></svg>What&#x27;s the difference between a savings account and money market account?</button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_5nnqqnpfiupfdb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1nnqqnpfiupfdb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="Accordion_accordionContent___gX9O" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4" tabindex="-1"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Our savings account includes buckets and boosters, designed to help you organize and optimize your savings. Like digital envelopes, savings buckets help you organize whatever you&#x27;re saving for without needing multiple accounts. Boosters like Surprise Savings and Round ups are money-saving tools to help you reach your goals faster.</p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Our money market account doesn&#x27;t have buckets and boosters, but does offer a debit card and checks.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="Accordion_accordionItem__M4BZW"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_27nqqnpfiupfdb_" class="Accordion_accordionHeader__CXvux Accordion_accordionTrigger__aXh6r" aria-label="Can I change or convert a Savings Account to a Money Market account?" data-radix-collection-item=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M Accordion_accordionTriggerIcon__egW7x" name="Chevron: Right" data-testid="Chevron: Right" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin"><path fill-rule="nonzero" d="M16 12a.959.959 0 0 1-.08.393c-.053.12-.137.235-.252.346l-5.094 4.995A.876.876 0 0 1 9.93 18a.905.905 0 0 1-.468-.123.946.946 0 0 1-.336-.333.926.926 0 0 1 .166-1.142L13.808 12 9.292 7.598A.926.926 0 0 1 9 6.926a.88.88 0 0 1 .126-.463.974.974 0 0 1 .336-.336A.887.887 0 0 1 9.93 6c.252 0 .467.089.644.266l5.094 4.995c.11.11.193.226.246.346.053.12.082.25.086.393Z"></path></svg>Can I change or convert a Savings Account to a Money Market account?</button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_67nqqnpfiupfdb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_27nqqnpfiupfdb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="Accordion_accordionContent___gX9O" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4" tabindex="-1"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">No, because the two account types include different features, and utilize different ways of accessing funds. Instead, a new Money Market Account <a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" href="https://secure.ally.com/open-account/?OAP=MMDA" target="_self">must be opened</a>. Then, you can choose to keep both accounts, or request to close the account you no longer want.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs">Still have questions? Visit our <a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" href="https://www.ally.com/help/bank/savings-money-market" target="_self">Help Center</a>.</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="styles_footer__ec6DM styles_-hasMobileStickyNav__X9R6O"><div class="styles_socialMediaLinks__ttevQ"><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="Instagram" href="https://www.instagram.com/ally/" target="_blank" aria-label="Instagram"><svg aria-hidden="false" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M" width="25" height="25" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Instagram Logo</title><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/kihwedicfgkh/6KjE8XEl1ezce7gJQFzLN9/dc480f599ce2e17e31f477e2de84f2d4/footer-instagram-logo.svg" width="25" height="25"></image></svg></a><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="LinkedIn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ally" target="_blank" aria-label="LinkedIn"><svg aria-hidden="false" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M" width="25" height="25" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>LinkedIn Logo</title><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/kihwedicfgkh/88FOAoCw3g1C8kqiuc5ze/0897c4e1db85be62a71991bf2d23d66e/LinkedInLogo.png" width="25" height="25"></image></svg></a><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="YouTube" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/ally" target="_blank" aria-label="YouTube"><svg aria-hidden="false" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M" width="25" height="25" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Youtube Logo</title><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/kihwedicfgkh/4Njgdi3b44Tnn6Uy9mQF2o/453436c042f27254e667da63794927ed/Youtube_Logo__1_.svg" width="25" height="25"></image></svg></a><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="Facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/ally" target="_blank" aria-label="Facebook"><svg aria-hidden="false" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M" width="25" height="25" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Facebook Logo</title><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/kihwedicfgkh/2LMJ9WlZiWU6OtQCRqbvob/9dd16b86bb0714fae4fac09e800eee3b/Facebook_Logo__1_.svg" width="25" height="25"></image></svg></a><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="TikTok" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@allydoitright" target="_blank" aria-label="TikTok"><svg aria-hidden="false" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M" width="25" height="25" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>TikTok Logo</title><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/kihwedicfgkh/5aEepFh5wRw9EuOGrlb1WR/f901a559b3287968cf8a4de7c240cd17/TikTok_Logo__1_.svg" width="25" height="25"></image></svg></a></div><div class="styles_additionalLinks__mLHCT"><div class="styles_linkGroup___iVE4"><span id="footer-linkGroup-l