",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Our Annual Percentage Yields (APYs) are accurate as of \",[\"$\",\"$L61\",\"effectiveDate-K239xxRExmwrfjnInwD3P-0\",{\"type\":\"Effective Date\",\"bankName\":\"Ally Bank\",\"accountType\":[\"OSA\",\"OSAV\",\"SDA\",\"OSAV-0\",\"OSAV-0M\"],\"staticBankRates\":\"$2e:props:children:0:props:children:3:props:children:1:props:staticBankRates\"}],\". Keep in mind, these rates are variable and may change after the account is open. Fees may reduce earnings. The APYs for other banks are provided by mybanktracker.com and are accurate as of \",[\"$\",\"$L61\",\"effectiveDate-2tD8GpM1GBleH3luT8wOIx-0\",{\"type\":\"Effective Date\",\"bankName\":\"Bank of America\",\"accountType\":[\"OSAV-0M\"],\"staticBankRates\":\"$2e:props:children:0:props:children:3:props:children:1:props:staticBankRates\"}],\". The APYs in this table are for the state of California and based on a minimum daily balance of $5,000.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Ally Bank Savings Accounts have a range of account balances called balance tiers. We’re required to tell you the APY we pay is based on the tier in which your end-of-day balance falls. The APY may remain the same for all balance tiers or change based on your account’s daily balance.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"5\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"That being said, we’ve simply made the current APY available across all our balance tiers.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h4\",\"6\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_h4\",\"className\":\"Text_heading-sm__X7nF6 -mt-xs -mb-xs\",\"tabIndex\":-1,\"children\":[\"Ally Bank Savings Account balance tiers:\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"RichText_richText