\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Get your account up and running in minutes.\"]}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"richText-2SwNr1OwdzQrgNsjjx4Jgy-1\",{\"className\":\"ListStep_container___R5wR\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"ol\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"ListStep_list__5oRr_ ListStep_list-stepper__d84SB ListStep_-white__KCjzA ListStep_-dark-mode__qXR9v\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\".$0\",{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item__z2Fii\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-container__6GC2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-number__1IcPr\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-dots__l3tJQ\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"Tell us about yourself.\"}],\"\\nWe'll need some personal info, like your address and Social Security number.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\".$1\",{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item__z2Fii\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-container__6GC2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-number__1IcPr\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-dots__l3tJQ\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"Add money to your account.\"}],\"\\nThe faster you fund, the sooner you'll earn interest.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\".$2\",{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item__z2Fii\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-container__6GC2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-number__1IcPr\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ListStep_list-item-dots__l3tJQ\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs -color-white\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"Enjoy all the perks.\"}],\"\\nStart exploring everything we have to offer.\"]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"link-4cvE4u7cObgYH7ohYEG1Xr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2a\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[\"dto/contentful/componentPlan.tsx -\u003e @/components/atoms/Link/LinkClient/LinkClient.client\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L6d\",null,{\"content\":\"Open New Account\",\"url\":\"https://secure.ally.com/open-account/?OAP=OSAV\",\"newTab\":false,\"displayAsCta\":\"Outline\",\"analyticsTagName\":\"defaultbanner-openNewAccount\",\"analyticsCarryParams\":\"DAO\",\"a11yAriaLabel\":\"Open Online Savings Account\",\"prefixIcon\":\"$undefined\",\"postfixIcon\":\"$undefined\",\"darkMode\":true,\"ariaLabel\":\"Open Online Savings Account\",\"targetId\":\"$undefined\",\"renderButtonAsLink\":\"$undefined\",\"isNavLink\":\"$undefined\",\"isInline\":false,\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"alignment\":\"$undefined\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]\n6f:T701,Over the past few years, I have tried my best to teach my children about the value of money. To them, everything from a cup of hot cocoa to a week’s stay at a hotel equals one credit card (specifically, mine) – the cost is hidden and the value is lost. \r\n\r\nI have them split their money, between jars marked Spend, Wait, and Save. Generally, Spend is for instant gratification, Wait is to wait until you have enough money to buy something you really want, and Save is to hold on to for a long time. The conversation surrounding the jars, allows them to think about the value of money.\r\n\r\nThe natural progress of the Save jar, is to bring it to a bank and open an account … or at least it was for my generation. It occurred to me that by the time my children will need to use a bank, they will do so, virtually: online and mobile, and may never walk into the retail, brick and mortar, banks of yester-year. \r\n\r\nI decided to take them through the journey of opening an Online Savings account with Ally Bank, and transferring their money into it. \r\n\r\nThe process was intuitive and gratifying. I love the clean interface, the ease of use, and the accessibility to the information we need. I also opened an account for myself, and set up automatic transfers, creating my own Save jar. I have highly recommended that friends and family, give Ally Bank a look, for their banking needs.You should too.\r\n\r\nAlly Bank’s Online Savings interest rate is the best in the market, but unfortunately, our economy is not letting me use interest rate as a reason to save for my children. They check their accounts, on a monthly bases, and aren’t particularly thrilled with their return … they probably won’t fully understand this feature, until it is time for them to buy a home. \r\n\r\nCheers, \r\nErik3d:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"experienceSection-fMq4u0xCWEAobobbGvMCm-13\",{\"children\":[false,[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"Section_section__CRZ0c \",\"id\":\"reviews\",\"data-track-mbox\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Section_sectionContainer__DiKn9\",\"children\":[\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Section_sectionContent__bg_Qs grid-col-1 Section_-align-center__4Bqiw Section_-align-top__26xRM\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"richText-2wA6YNbrhrJAfRt7PaaaEl-0\",{\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"Section_sectionRichTextWrapper__LvO_c RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_h2\",\"className\":\"Text_heading-lg__xw3JL -mt-xxs -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC\",\"tabIndex\":-1,\"children\":[\"The reviews are in.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"People like it here. We think you will, too.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",\"2\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_h3\",\"className\":\"Text_heading-md__A6fRB -mt-sm -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC\",\"tabIndex\":-1,\"children\":[\"Average Rating\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L47\",\"productRating-undefined-0\",{\"analyticsTagName\":\"reviewsWithCount\",\"className\":\"RichText_rating__TIR__ Section_sectionRichTextWrapper__LvO_c\",\"contentType\":\"productRating\",\"darkMode\":\"$undefined\",\"includeReviewsCount\":true,\"product\":{\"product\":\"Savings\",\"productName\":\"Savings Account\",\"shortProductName\":\"Savings\",\"productCode\":4107,\"accountType\":[\"OSA\",\"OSAV\",\"SDA\",\"OSAV-0\",\"OSAV-0M\"],\"eprLink\":\"/products-and-rates/savings-and-checking/0/0/0/\"},\"reviewsPageLink\":{\"entryLabel\":\"Bank: Online Savings Account: Link to Reviews Page\",\"content\":\"Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://www.ally.com/reviews/bank/savings-account/\",\"newTab\":false,\"analyticsTagName\":\"ratings-osa-1\",\"id\":\"Lq57JghDOQ3DefxfeWFlg\",\"contentType\":\"link\",\"prefixIcon\":\"$undefined\",\"postfixIcon\":\"$undefined\",\"displayAsCta\":\"$undefined\",\"darkMode\":\"$undefined\",\"ariaLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"targetId\":\"$undefined\",\"renderButtonAsLink\":\"$undefined\",\"isNavLink\":\"$undefined\",\"isInline\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"alignment\":\"$undefined\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"$undefined\"}}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"experienceContent-2jdJ9TPjNMC1YhqzCmAaef-1\",{\"className\":\" ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-3 ExperienceContent_-align-center__Atnpk ExperienceContent_-align-top__k5GPm\",\"data-track-mbox\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"card-7zTV4ivPg1WerVHLzOFNtT-0\",{\"className\":\"Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-default__uD2Gt Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ\",\"data-nosnippet\":\"$undefined\",\"style\":{\"backgroundImage\":\"$undefined\"},\"data-track-mbox\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6e\",\"productReviewExcerpt-undefined-0\",{\"analyticsTagName\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"productReviewExcerpt\",\"includeRating\":true,\"productId\":\"osa\",\"reviewType\":\"Most Helpful\",\"staticProductReviews\":[{\"date\":\"2016-08-08T21:10:09.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"123740585\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"$6f\",\"title\":\"Ally Bank is intuitive and gratifying, good rates and great service.\",\"type\":\"Most Helpful\",\"user\":\"Noteboom\"},{\"date\":\"2014-02-10T08:25:33.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"53912453\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Ok, let me start by stating that I have both a checking and a savings account with Ally. This combination is a must if you plan to access your money from your savings account\\n\\nThe Savings APY is one of the highest in the market which is just great and most of my deposit have taken less than a day to post on my account.\\n\\nIf I need cash from my savings I can just easily transfer it to my checking account and then use my debit card to make purchases and/or withdraw at an atm.\\n\\nAlso I have a BofA checking account so if I ever need a specific amount of money from my savings, I can just transfer it to my Ally checking account and then write myself a check (free Ally checks for checking account) and cash it at my local BofA branch!!\\n\\nI love my savings and checking accounts which are the perfect ally to my BofA account\",\"title\":\"Awesome!!\",\"type\":\"Most Helpful\",\"user\":\"Salek\"},{\"date\":\"2012-11-13T23:57:05.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"36637182\",\"rating\":4,\"text\":\"Very good rates, easy account setup. But it is difficult to transfer money out of the account to your external account. Even though you abide to the company's transaction limits, you cannot make transfers two days in a row- you are forced to wait until the first transfer fully completes, in about three days, before you can begin another transfer. Other online banks don't have this problem/restriction.\",\"title\":\"Good Rates, but transfers are a hassle\",\"type\":\"Most Helpful\",\"user\":\"JJYY\"},{\"date\":\"2013-01-21T04:45:58.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"38745967\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Super easy to open an account - almost all the verification was done online with just one piece paper to sign \u0026 mail. Website is very user friendly. Customer service is prompt \u0026 courteous. Interest rate is quite competitive. All in all, a hassle-free online savings account with surperior customer service to boot!\",\"title\":\"One of the best online savings accounts out there\",\"type\":\"Most Helpful\",\"user\":\"sviks\"},{\"date\":\"2012-12-27T14:35:04.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"38002885\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"I locked myself out due to multiple password attempts. I did not call Ally right away and waited after the holiday. When I called, the agent verified my identity and stayed on the phone with me until I was able to successfully logged in. The agent was very courteous and helpful. What makes this a TOP notch service, online it tells you how many minutes wait time. When I called it says 5min but when I actually got through the agent, it was less than 3mins. Prompt, no wait time and just superb support. Moreover, it gives me great comfort to know your customer support speaks fluent English. Thank you Ally.\",\"title\":\"Customer Service is TOP Notch\",\"type\":\"Most Helpful\",\"user\":\"TimeTraveler\"},{\"date\":\"2015-10-12T02:47:08.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"91397585\",\"rating\":4,\"text\":\"Have been satisfied with using Ally as my main savings account. Until I received an email saying rates for savings accounts are about to change and become tier based...with no additional information on how those tiers will be paid. While I appreciate the notice, I don't appreciate the vagueness of the message.\",\"title\":\"It's been a good experience until that last email\",\"type\":\"Most Helpful\",\"user\":\"DawnSaving\"}]}]]}],\"$L70\",\"$L71\"]}]]}]]}]}]]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"experienceSection-50nffqaRZgpImxUhXMGYFM-14\",{\"children\":[false,[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"SectionFAQ_section__cdJWv \",\"id\":\"faqs\",\"data-track-mbox\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"SectionFAQ_sectionContainer__Zp66O\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"Text_heading-lg__xw3JL SectionFAQ_sectionHeading__b_Eym -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":-1,\"children\":\"FAQs\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"Text_subtitle-md__KAvok -mt-0 -mb-sm SectionFAQ_sectionSubHeading__Z8b8w -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":\"We have answers.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"SectionFAQ_sectionContent__a7atb grid-col-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L72\",\"sharedFaqGroup-6WzFwDQTXI9ddX8TU1tddW-0\",{\"items\":[{\"title\":\"How do I add money to my account?\",\"content\":[\"$\",\"div\",\"sharedFaqGroup-6WzFwDQTXI9ddX8TU1tddW-0\",{\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"RichText_richText__314m4\",\"tabIndex\":-1,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"There are several ways to add money to your account: \"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"1. Online transfers:\"}],\" You can transfer money from another Ally account or an account you have at another institution, right from our app. Select\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"2\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\" Menu \"}],\"and then \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"4\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"Linked Accounts \"}],\"to link your accounts at other banks. \"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"2. Ally eCheck Deposit℠:\"}],\" You can deposit a check in our app with your phone’s camera. Make sure each check is properly endorsed with signatures of all payees. Also write \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"2\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"For Mobile Deposit Only \"}],\"on the back. \"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"3. Wire transfer:\"}],\" If you want to wire money from an account you have at another institution, select \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"2\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"Menu \"}],\"and then choose\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"4\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\" Wire Money.\"}],\" Then select \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"6\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"Receive a wire\"}],\" for more info on how you can wire from another financial institution into your Ally Bank account. \"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"4. Mail yo