"style\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"Tooltip_richText__NHUGe RichText_richText__314m4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"Domestic outgoing wire\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"An electronic transfer from one U.S. bank account to another made through the Federal Reserve Wire Network.\"]}]]}],\"analyticsTagName\":\"$undefined\",\"label\":\"domestic\",\"alignment\":\"$undefined\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"$undefined\",\"darkMode\":\"$undefined\"}],\" wires\"]}]}]],\"RichText-Table-header-2\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"RichText_richText__314m4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-sm__UmmDO -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"$$20\"}]]}]}]]}],\"template\":\"table-justify\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"div\",\"card-2ErOwtX0Z07LUejM7TbniS-1\",{\"className\":\"Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-default__uD2Gt Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ\",\"data-nosnippet\":\"$undefined\",\"style\":{\"backgroundImage\":\"$undefined\"},\"data-track-mbox\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6e\",\"productReviewExcerpt-undefined-0\",{\"analyticsTagName\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"productReviewExcerpt\",\"includeRating\":true,\"productId\":\"osa\",\"reviewType\":\"Most Recent\",\"staticProductReviews\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-27T01:41:12.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"272370981\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"My experience with Ally Banking has been wonderful. I am new to investing and can CLEARLY see why Ally Banking is soo effective. It is refreshing to start with a new bank that provided more APY on your money compared to the local bank that I grew up with. I look forward to transferring more funds into Ally accounts now that my credit card debt is zero! I look forward to investing with Ally Banking for years to come.  Using Ally Banking will help me save for a future home! Thank you Ally Banking and staff. Eventually I want to open more accounts.\",\"title\":\"Ally Banking Should Be Used By Everyone\",\"type\":\"Most Recent\",\"user\":\"Haughton\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-27T00:26:24.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"272368276\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"I love the Bucket feature that Ally provides because it allows me to set savings goals for every kind of goal I have. The ability to transfer funds from one bucket to another is seemless. \\n\\nMy only con to the savings bucket is that when a goal is created for a certain amount and is due by a certain date, I would like the ability to see what is the minimum amount I need to transfer monthly to hit that goal, by the deadline. Currently I have to calculate the amount myself and check my finances outside of Ally to see if I can hit the goal.\\n\\nI would like to see Ally incorporate awards for savings account. For example, if a savings goals is met there should be a notification or award icon that shows the accomplishment. Another example could be hitting $1k, $5k, $10k+ ($5k increments in savings) and receiving awards for that. \\n\\nLastly, I would like to see loyalty awards for years and total savings achieved over the span of time the account has been open.\",\"title\":\"Account Features\",\"type\":\"Most Recent\",\"user\":\"LivingLife2theFullest\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-25T23:30:27.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"272342170\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"It took to much time, I transfer money to ally account from my bank\",\"title\":\"transfer ia very slow\",\"type\":\"Most Recent\",\"user\":\"davood f\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-18T00:47:24.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"272036484\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"We’ve had this account for over a year and it makes saving so easy! Transferring from my local bank takes just a few clicks and transferring to my local bank is just as easy. The buckets make it fun to see our goals and plans in real time! It’s exciting to see the progress as the money grows. We’ve been able to save for big ticket items because of how easy it is to put money into this account.\",\"title\":\"Makes Saving Easy\",\"type\":\"Most Recent\",\"user\":\"SKWfam\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10T13:06:48.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"271782302\",\"rating\":4,\"text\":\"I opened my account a couple weeks ago after my last bank decided it was okay to close my checking account, regardless of the many attempts I tried to communicate with them. What a pain!  \\nAlly’s interest rates are so much better than I have imagined and the account was easy to open. \\nThe only trouble I’ve had is that for two weeks now, no debit card has arrived and I’m still relying on my previous account to access cash.  I would love nothing more than to finally close that account.  Why does it take this long for a debit card to arrive?  Why 10 days?  Why is it not 2nd day delivered?  \\nThe funds that I did transfer took about a week to transfer over too but I’m satisfied knowing that I have my earnings in a stable and secure financially, secure institution!\",\"title\":\"Much better than my previous bank\",\"type\":\"Most Recent\",\"user\":\"p0rt0kali\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10T02:21:31.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"271775239\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Ally makes banking and investing easy.  I was a little hesitant when I first joined because I didn't have experience doing business with an online banking institution.  Since, I joined with Ally I have only had good experiences.  The customer service is friendly and helpful, the bank offers excellent rates on all of their products, and linking accounts is a breeze.  Overall, I am happy I am a customer!\",\"title\":\"Banking made easy!\",\"type\":\"Most Recent\",\"user\":\"Cactus Country\"}]}]]}]\n71:[\"$\",\"div\",\"card-OfKjZ8wNVjIY3xamIOcUJ-2\",{\"className\":\"Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-default__uD2Gt Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ\",\"data-nosnippet\":\"$undefined\",\"style\":{\"backgroundImage\":\"$undefined\"},\"data-track-mbox\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6e\",\"productReviewExcerpt-undefined-0\",{\"analyticsTagName\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"productReviewExcerpt\",\"includeRating\":true,\"productId\":\"osa\",\"reviewType\":\"Highest Rating\",\"staticProductReviews\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-27T01:41:12.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"272370981\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"My experience with Ally Banking has been wonderful. I am new to investing and can CLEARLY see why Ally Banking is soo effective. It is refreshing to start with a new bank that provided more APY on your money compared to the local bank that I grew up with. I look forward to transferring more funds into Ally accounts now that my credit card debt is zero! I look forward to investing with Ally Banking for years to come.  Using Ally Banking will help me save for a future home! Thank you Ally Banking and staff. Eventually I want to open more accounts.\",\"title\":\"Ally Banking Should Be Used By Everyone\",\"type\":\"Highest Rating\",\"user\":\"Haughton\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-27T00:26:24.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"272368276\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"I love the Bucket feature that Ally provides because it allows me to set savings goals for every kind of goal I have. The ability to transfer funds from one bucket to another is seemless. \\n\\nMy only con to the savings bucket is that when a goal is created for a certain amount and is due by a certain date, I would like the ability to see what is the minimum amount I need to transfer monthly to hit that goal, by the deadline. Currently I have to calculate the amount myself and check my finances outside of Ally to see if I can hit the goal.\\n\\nI would like to see Ally incorporate awards for savings account. For example, if a savings goals is met there should be a notification or award icon that shows the accomplishment. Another example could be hitting $1k, $5k, $10k+ ($5k increments in savings) and receiving awards for that. \\n\\nLastly, I would like to see loyalty awards for years and total savings achieved over the span of time the account has been open.\",\"title\":\"Account Features\",\"type\":\"Highest Rating\",\"user\":\"LivingLife2theFullest\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-25T23:30:27.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"272342170\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"It took to much time, I transfer money to ally account from my bank\",\"title\":\"transfer ia very slow\",\"type\":\"Highest Rating\",\"user\":\"davood f\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-18T00:47:24.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"272036484\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"We’ve had this account for over a year and it makes saving so easy! Transferring from my local bank takes just a few clicks and transferring to my local bank is just as easy. The buckets make it fun to see our goals and plans in real time! It’s exciting to see the progress as the money grows. We’ve been able to save for big ticket items because of how easy it is to put money into this account.\",\"title\":\"Makes Saving Easy\",\"type\":\"Highest Rating\",\"user\":\"SKWfam\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10T02:21:31.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"271775239\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Ally makes banking and investing easy.  I was a little hesitant when I first joined because I didn't have experience doing business with an online banking institution.  Since, I joined with Ally I have only had good experiences.  The customer service is friendly and helpful, the bank offers excellent rates on all of their products, and linking accounts is a breeze.  Overall, I am happy I am a customer!\",\"title\":\"Banking made easy!\",\"type\":\"Highest Rating\",\"user\":\"Cactus Country\"},{\"date\":\"2026-09-09T23:24:18.000+00:00\",\"id\":\"271770042\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"I like that it was easy to make this saving account ally ban has always taken care of me which is much better then other banks ive used . Ive had my checking for at least 3 or 4 years now , i highly recommend them\",\"title\":\"Happy\",\"type\":\"Highest Rating\",\"user\":\"Dr762\"}]}]]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\"6. Add cash to a Spending Account: \"}],\"Visit a Walmart Money Center or customer service desk and show the associate your unique barcode to add cash. To get your barcode, log in to our app, go to\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"2\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\" Menu \"}],\"and select\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"4\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_mark_bold\",\"children\":\" Add Cash\"}],\".\"]}]\n74:[\"$\",\"div\",\"sharedFaqGroup-6WzFwDQTXI9ddX8TU1tddW-0\",{\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"RichText_richText__314m4\",\"tabIndex\":-1,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"You can make 10 limited withdrawals and transfers per statement cycle from your Savings Account. There’s no fee for going over the limit, but we’ll close your account if you exceed it on more than an occasional basis.\"]}]]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"div\",\"sharedFaqGroup-6WzFwDQTXI9ddX8TU1tddW-0\",{\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"RichText_richText__314m4\",\"tabIndex\":-1,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Our savings account includes buckets and boosters, designed to help you organize and optimize your savings. Like digital envelopes, savings buckets help you organize whatever you're saving for without needing multiple accounts. Boosters like Surprise Savings and Round ups are money-saving tools to help you reach your goals faster.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Our money market account doesn't have buckets and boosters, but does offer a debit card and checks.\"]}]]}]\n76:[\"$\",\"div\",\"sharedFaqGroup-6WzFwDQTXI9ddX8TU1tddW-0\",{\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"RichText_richText__314m4\",\"tabIndex\":-1,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"No, because the two account types include different features, and utilize different ways of accessing funds. Instead, a new Money Market Account \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"link-1RJVTtCgpqL6KsHREaxlgQ-0\",{\"className\":\"Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe\",\"data-allytmln\":\"$undefined\",\"href\":\"https://secure.ally.com/open-account/?OAP=MMDA\",\"onClick\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"_self\",\"aria-describedby\":\"$undefined\",\"aria-label\":\"$undefined\",\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"data-testid\":\"$undefined\",\"role\":\"$undefined\",\"data-target-id\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$undefined\",\"must be opened\",\"$undefined\"]}],\". Then, you can choose to keep both accounts, or request to close the account you no longer want.\"]}]]}]\n77:[\"$\",\"div\",\"richText-7JdvBtuux0bUzrtm8FUND4-1\",{\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"data-testid\":\"RichTextTestId_block_p\",\"className\":\"Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs\",\"tabIndex\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"Still have questions? Visit our \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"link-1a6Udr41rkFKjqyuYXAyoy-0\",{\